# Lure of the Wildcat (Windurst) (windurst 94): Ibwam in Windurst Woods and twenty NPCs in the four Windurst zones. The
# guard (ENABLE_TOAU 1, the default): 736 (the Green Sentinel Badge, begun); Ibwam's 737 at Prog 0, 738 with some bits,
# 739 with all twenty (the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the Green Invitation Card, fame 0); each NPC's event
# once (its bit unset) and nil after (Soni-Muni is talked to twice). Completed: Ibwam's own script (740 before ToAU's
# President Salaheem). #toau_off is the guard's other side, #gm isFull's edges, #kinds repeats 736.
# Ibwam's script always answers (740): the quest's Events 737 / 738 take turns with it (the lookup's alternation), so
# he is talked to twice with some bits; 739 is a Progress event (#gm: right after an Event 738). Each NPC's event is a
# Progress event: Soni-Muni's 735 plays again after a GM reset of her bit, where an Event would fall back to her script.
# The char is a WAR of level 20 at fame 0, Mihgo's Amigo completed by GM (its offer 80 at Nanaa Mihgo is a Progress at
# any fame; completed without a mustZone it is nil), so the other quests at these NPCs stay silent: The Amazin' Scorpio
# (Soni-Muni's script, fame level 2), Making Headlines (Umumu's script, not accepted), Curses Foiled Again (Shantotto:
# its Event 171 at any fame, under the wildcat Progress), Wonder Wands (Yaman-Hachuman's script), mission 3-3 (Kyume-Romeh,
# Yujuju: not current). Each NPC's first talk is the wildcat Progress; the NPC is not talked to again.
lists WindurstWoods/Ibwam/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Ibwam/onTrade WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/736 WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/739 WindurstWoods/Soni-Muni/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Etsa_Rhuyuli/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Cayu_Pensharhumi/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Umumu/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Yoriri/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Shantotto/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Moan-Maon/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Chomomo/onTrigger WindurstWalls/Naih_Arihmepp/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Npopo/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Lago-Charago/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Amagusa-Chigurusa/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Funpo-Shipo/onTrigger WindurstWaters/Kyume-Romeh/onTrigger PortWindurst/Kunchichi/onTrigger PortWindurst/Yaman-Hachuman/onTrigger PortWindurst/Choyi_Totlihpa/onTrigger PortWindurst/Three_of_Clubs/onTrigger PortWindurst/Yujuju/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=-24,2.75,-59 job=WAR lvl=20
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
item BoneChip
login
trade Ibwam BoneChip x1        # available: no trade handler; his script's trade (300 gil only): nothing
trigger Soni-Muni              # available: no handler, her script's 421 (fame 0)
finish
trigger Ibwam                  # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 736
finish                         # the Green Sentinel Badge, begun
trigger Ibwam                  # Prog 0: 737
finish
trigger Soni-Muni              # 735
finish                         # bit 0
charvar Quest[2][94]Prog 0
trigger Soni-Muni              # bit 0 unset again (GM): 735, a Progress event (an Event would fall back to her script)
finish                         # bit 0
trigger Soni-Muni              # bit 0 set: nil, her script's 421
finish
trigger Ibwam                  # some bits: the quest's Event 738, but his last answer was the Event 737, so the lookup
                               # alternates to his script (UseFallback): 740
finish
trigger Ibwam                  # some bits: 738
finish
trigger Etsa_Rhuyuli           # 734
finish                         # bit 1
trigger Cayu_Pensharhumi       # 733
finish                         # bit 2
trigger Umumu                  # 731
finish                         # bit 3
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99         # 732
finish                         # bit 4
warp 65,-7.5,-56 WindurstWalls
trigger Yoriri                 # 496
finish                         # bit 5
trigger Shantotto              # 498
finish                         # bit 6
trigger Moan-Maon              # 497
finish                         # bit 7
trigger Chomomo                # 499
finish                         # bit 8
trigger Naih_Arihmepp          # 500
finish                         # bit 9
warp -35,-5,237 WindurstWaters
trigger Npopo                  # 936
finish                         # bit 10
trigger Lago-Charago           # 940
finish                         # bit 11
trigger Amagusa-Chigurusa      # 937
finish                         # bit 12
trigger Funpo-Shipo            # 938
finish                         # bit 13
trigger Kyume-Romeh            # 939
finish                         # bit 14
warp -114,-3.25,108 PortWindurst
trigger Kunchichi              # 623
finish                         # bit 15
trigger Yaman-Hachuman         # 624
finish                         # bit 16
trigger Choyi_Totlihpa         # 622
finish                         # bit 17
trigger Three_of_Clubs         # 625
finish                         # bit 18
trigger Yujuju                 # 621
finish                         # bit 19: Prog 0xFFFFF
warp -24,2.75,-59 WindurstWoods
trigger Ibwam                  # all twenty: 739
finish                         # the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the Green Invitation Card
trigger Ibwam                  # completed: no section, his own script's 740
finish
